# Ship the whole .claude/ project config (skills, hooks, commands, agents,
# settings.json, launch.json, serve script) so both machines stay in sync.
# Exclude only the genuinely per-machine files:
#   - settings.local.json: local permission grants, not meant to be shared.
.claude/settings.local.json
*.local.json
#   - transient runtime state (lock files, etc.)
.claude/*.lock

# Full-resolution dungeon / battlemap sources (CzePeku and other paid assets)
# are kept LOCAL ONLY and never published to GitHub Pages. Drop full-res
# originals in a `_full/` subfolder under any campaign's maps/; only the
# downsized web copies that sit directly in maps/ get committed.
campaigns/**/assets/maps/_full/

# pf2e encounter-builder: the cloned Foundry bestiary source (~250MB, re-clonable)
# and the rebuildable SQLite snapshot are local-only build artifacts. Run
# `python rebuild.py` to regenerate both. Homebrew creature JSON IS committed.
campaigns/tools/encounterBuilder/_sources/
campaigns/tools/encounterBuilder/bestiary.db
campaigns/tools/encounterBuilder/items.db
